What is Maven?
--------------------
Maven is Apache foundation project
Maven is build and project management tool
Maven Followed by developers and Testers

What is POM.xml file
----------------------------
POM stands for Project Object Model.
IT is configuration file for entire maven project
In this file we can add required Plugins and required dependencies

Structure of POM.xml
------------------------
<Project>

<dependencies>

<dependency>Selenium</dependency>
<dependency>TestNG</dependency>

</dependencies>


</project>
