WebDriver Browser Commands/Methods
==========================================
1.get(url): Open application within browser
2.getTitle(): get the current page title of the application
3.getCurrentUrl(): get the current page url of the application
4.getPageSource(): get the page source of application/page
5.close(): close the current active browser 
6.quit(): close all the browser open through selenium

